# Transwarp Hub {2}{U} (cast on turn 1 off a Black Lotus, a Mox Sapphire, a Mox Emerald and a Mox Pearl) mills the five
# cards under its controller's library and takes two of the three artifact cards among them into hand - no more than two
# (CR 701.17a, 608.2d). Station with the 2/2 Grizzly Bears gives two charge counters, and at two the Hub has no {T}
# ability (the 3+ striation, CR 721.2a): the refusal proves it. A second station on turn 3 with the 1/1 Healer's Hawk
# makes three, and now "{T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn" is offered: the Hub taps and the targeted Grizzly
# Bears can't be blocked this turn (CR 509.1b, 611.2c).

